          "en": "And there is another approach which is called eloquent ORM.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 37.43,
          "end": 44.15,
          "en": "So from this video we'll be seeing how to work with eloquent ORM and how to interact with database with",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 44.15,
          "end": 44.63,
