        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 52.01,
          "end": 53.78,
          "en": "Then click on introduction.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 54.23,
          "end": 56.87,
          "en": "Let's see what Laravel says about eloquent ORM.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 57.05,
          "end": 63.74,
          "en": "So in the introduction it is saying that Laravel includes, uh, eloquent a object relational mapper.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 63.77,
          "end": 72.01,
          "en": "Or you can say ORM at its heart that makes it enjoyable to interact with your database when using elegant.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 72.03999999999999,
          "end": 76.51,
          "en": "Each database table has a corresponding model that is used to interact.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 77.83,
          "end": 78.67,
          "en": "Sorry.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 81.46000000000001,
          "end": 82.51,
          "en": "Where was we?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 82.6,
          "end": 82.84,
          "en": "Okay.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 82.87,
          "end": 88.69,
          "en": "Interact with the table in addition to retrieving records from the database table.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 88.72,
          "end": 95.17,
          "en": "Elegant models allow you to insert, update delete records from the table as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 95.2,
          "end": 100.81,
          "en": "So as I said in my model video, whenever you will create a table, you will create a model.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 100.96000000000001,
          "end": 108.22,
          "en": "Because model is the part of the MVC pattern and it is it it it will be the responsible responsible",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 108.22,
          "end": 110.62,
          "en": "for interacting with the database.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 110.62,
          "end": 118.09,
          "en": "As I said in our application and database, in between the model will be placed all the request.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 118.09,
          "end": 123.31,
          "en": "I mean, all the database interactions will be done by the model itself.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 123.31,
          "end": 126.01,
          "en": "And you cannot use model.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 126.58,
          "end": 131.26,
          "en": "Uh, I mean, you cannot use eloquent without having a model.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 131.29,
          "end": 136.57,
          "en": "Previously, when we work with Query Builder, we directly select the table.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 136.57,
          "end": 140.29,
          "en": "Then we manipulate the table or read the table.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 140.71,
          "end": 144.77,
          "en": "But in case of models we will not select the table.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 144.8,
          "end": 147.2,
          "en": "We will not directly interact with the table.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 147.2,
          "end": 152.54,
          "en": "There will be models for each of the table which will help us to interact with the table.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 153.29,
          "end": 160.52,
          "en": "It is more efficient and also model give us lots of flexibility so that we can use in our project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 160.52,
          "end": 164.51,
          "en": "And the query will be really small.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 164.51,
          "end": 174.95,
          "en": "We can write larger queries, larger relational queries in shorter term the and it will be really human",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 174.95,
          "end": 176.36,
          "en": "readable as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 176.69,
          "end": 183.71,
          "en": "So that's why most of the time, or you can say most of the developer use and prefer eloquent their",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 183.71,
          "end": 184.43,
          "en": "project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 184.43,
          "end": 187.01,
          "en": "And it's not like we don't use Query Builder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 187.01,
          "end": 188.72,
          "en": "We do use query query builder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 188.72,
          "end": 194.15,
          "en": "And most of the time we use both of the both of the approach, I mean query builder and eloquent or",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 194.15,
          "end": 196.49,
          "en": "I mean our project, which is totally fine.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 196.49,
          "end": 201.32,
          "en": "You can use both of the approaches in your project together.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 201.56,
          "end": 202.7,
          "en": "Nothing wrong there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 202.73,
          "end": 205.94,
          "en": "It basically depends what you are trying to do.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 205.97,
          "end": 209.75,
          "en": "Like Query builder is little bit faster than eloquent.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 209.75,
          "end": 213.11,
          "en": "That's not mean that eloquent is slow, eloquent.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 213.2,
          "end": 215.03,
          "en": "Eloquent is absolutely fast.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 215.03,
          "end": 222.59,
          "en": "But when you are loading lots of lots of data and you you need to handle more and more complex queries",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 222.59,
          "end": 226.19,
          "en": "for data that I mean, query optimization and all.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 226.19,
          "end": 232.85,
          "en": "In that time, query builder is a little bit more preferable than eloquent otherwise warm can.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 232.88,
          "end": 234.98,
          "en": "I mean, eloquent can handle a lot.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 235.01,
          "end": 236.66,
          "en": "Lots of data as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 236.69,
          "end": 243.47,
          "en": "But for a little bit of optimization we go with the query builder most of the time.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 243.47,
          "end": 251.39,
          "en": "But normally in the entire project we use eloquent because, uh, you can you can write codes, I mean",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 251.39,
          "end": 253.31,
          "en": "queries really easily in short.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 253.31,
          "end": 257.36,
          "en": "And also it is human readable, really easy to read.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 257.36,
          "end": 264.98,
          "en": "So whenever a user will see your code, he will understand what is happening under the hood or what",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 264.98,
          "end": 266.81,
          "en": "the code is saying.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 266.81,
